Package: runeverything
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Open-source remote agent for Intent Computing
 Headless agent that pairs via QR code and exposes a PTY session
 through a relay for Intent Computing clients (e.g. KoKo).
 .
 Install, then run: runeverything pair
 Optional user service: systemctl --user enable --now runeverything
